{"id":"3dad3d3806b81f88","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter.md","title":"ZFC Inner Standard Parameter","display":"df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter — ZFC Inner Standard Parameter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter","58-df-zfc-inner4-standard-parameter"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter — ZFC Inner Standard Parameter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner-projectum]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper]]","[[../batch20/58-df-well-order]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter</span><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-standard-parameter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-standard-parameter — ZFC Inner Standard Parameter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse\">58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab2162d43c982825\" href=\"?note=ab2162d43c982825\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner-projectum\">58-df-zfc-inner-projectum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment\">../batch03/58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper\">../batch06/58-df-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order\">../batch20/58-df-well-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ee7c4e8a31dc0b92\" href=\"?note=ee7c4e8a31dc0b92\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function\">58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is the transitive carrier of a premouse code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[\\operatorname{Ord}^M]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(p\\in[\\operatorname{Ord}^M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\triangleleft_M\\subseteq M^2\">\\(\\triangleleft_M\\subseteq M^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_M\\in M\">\\(0_M\\in M\\)</span> are the canonical well-order and least element determined by the premouse construction; the data predicate also exposes them as explicit arguments.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n(\\Sigma_\\in)\">\\(\\Sigma_n(\\Sigma_\\in)\\)</span> is the set of membership-language formula codes of Lévy complexity at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerProjectum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerProjectum}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PremouseCanonicalSkolem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PremouseCanonicalSkolem}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PremouseSkolemHull}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PremouseSkolemHull}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PremouseFiniteParameterOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PremouseFiniteParameterOrder}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameterData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameterData}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4StandardParameter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4StandardParameter}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PremouseCanonicalSkolem}_S(F,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{WellOrder}(M,\\triangleleft_M)\\land0_M\\in M\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;(x=0_M\\lor\\langle0_M,x\\rangle\\in\\triangleleft_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(F,\\Sigma_n(\\Sigma_\\in)\\times M^{&lt;\\omega},M\\right)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\Sigma_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n(\\Sigma_\\in)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in M^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall b\\in M\\;\\left[\nF(\\langle\\varphi,\\bar a\\rangle)=b\\leftrightarrow\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left.\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(s,\\langle b\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall c\\in M\\;\\forall r\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(r,\\langle c\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,r)\\to\\neg\\langle c,b\\rangle\\in\\triangleleft_M\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\lor\\Bigl(b=0_M\\land\\neg\\exists c\\in M\\;\\exists r\\;(\n\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(r,\\langle c\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,r))\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}skolem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PremouseCanonicalSkolem}_S(F,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{WellOrder}(M,\\triangleleft_M)\\land0_M\\in M\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;(x=0_M\\lor\\langle0_M,x\\rangle\\in\\triangleleft_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(F,\\Sigma_n(\\Sigma_\\in)\\times M^{&lt;\\omega},M\\right)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\Sigma_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n(\\Sigma_\\in)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in M^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall b\\in M\\;\\left[\nF(\\langle\\varphi,\\bar a\\rangle)=b\\leftrightarrow\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left.\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(s,\\langle b\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall c\\in M\\;\\forall r\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(r,\\langle c\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,r)\\to\\neg\\langle c,b\\rangle\\in\\triangleleft_M\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\lor\\Bigl(b=0_M\\land\\neg\\exists c\\in M\\;\\exists r\\;(\n\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(r,\\langle c\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,r))\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PremouseSkolemHull}_S(H,X,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PremouseCanonicalSkolem}_S(F,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\land\nH=\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq M:\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;X\\cap M\\subseteq C\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n(\\Sigma_\\in)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in C^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\nF(\\langle\\varphi,\\bar a\\rangle)\\in C\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}hull}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PremouseSkolemHull}_S(H,X,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PremouseCanonicalSkolem}_S(F,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\land\nH=\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq M:\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;X\\cap M\\subseteq C\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n(\\Sigma_\\in)\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in C^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\nF(\\langle\\varphi,\\bar a\\rangle)\\in C\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}finite\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PremouseFiniteParameterOrder}_S(q,p,M)\\leftrightarrow q,p\\in[\\operatorname{Ord}^M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land q\\neq p\\land\n\\max(q\\mathbin{\\triangle}p)\\in p\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}finite\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PremouseFiniteParameterOrder}_S(q,p,M)\\leftrightarrow q,p\\in[\\operatorname{Ord}^M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land q\\neq p\\land\n\\max(q\\mathbin{\\triangle}p)\\in p\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameterData}_S(p,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land p\\in[\\operatorname{Ord}^M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal P,\\vec E\\;(\\mathcal P=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(\\mathcal P,\\vec E))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists H,\\rho\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerProjectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PremouseSkolemHull}_S(H,\\rho\\cup\\{p\\},M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\land H=M\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall q\\in[\\operatorname{Ord}^M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\n\\exists H,\\rho\\;\\left[\\mathrm{ZfcInnerProjectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PremouseSkolemHull}_S(H,\\rho\\cup\\{q\\},M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\land H=M\\right]\n\\to\\neg\\mathrm{PremouseFiniteParameterOrder}_S(q,p,M)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameterData}_S(p,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land p\\in[\\operatorname{Ord}^M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal P,\\vec E\\;(\\mathcal P=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(\\mathcal P,\\vec E))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists H,\\rho\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerProjectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PremouseSkolemHull}_S(H,\\rho\\cup\\{p\\},M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\land H=M\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall q\\in[\\operatorname{Ord}^M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\n\\exists H,\\rho\\;\\left[\\mathrm{ZfcInnerProjectum}_S(\\rho,M,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{PremouseSkolemHull}_S(H,\\rho\\cup\\{q\\},M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\land H=M\\right]\n\\to\\neg\\mathrm{PremouseFiniteParameterOrder}_S(q,p,M)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}canonical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameterData}_S(p,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}canonical}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameterData}_S(p,M,n,\\triangleleft_M,0_M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4StandardParameter}_S(M,n,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}standard\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4StandardParameter}_S(M,n,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerStandardParameter}_S(p,M,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Skolem function chooses the least witness in the explicitly supplied premouse well-order; typed membership structures, assignments, and satisfaction recursions replace the former free <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\">\\(M\\models\\varphi[\\bar a]\\)</span> notation. The three-place compatibility predicate specializes the data predicate to the canonical order terms determined by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The standard parameter is the least finite ordinal set, in the displayed reverse-lexicographic well-order, that generates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> over its <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-th projectum.</li>\n<li>The premouse predicate is applied to the structure code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\">\\(\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\)</span>, while functions, projecta, hulls, and ordinal parameters are applied to its carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This direct premouse definition removes the former circular dependency through <code>58-df-zfc-model7-fine-structural-model</code>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-inner4-standard-parameter</code> is the reordered compatibility alias.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner-projectum","status":"resolved","id":"ab2162d43c982825","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner-projectum]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor"